{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"I'm pretty sure our staff is a majority queer , and we are clearly a server and a free service that tries to keep ourselves in line with good gender ethics.\nPlease refer to rule 2 with any direct warning.","created_at":"2021-07-05T23:41:42.086000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"861753739411718144","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"2. Be Respectful to everyone. Hate language will not be tolerated. Include your pronouns (examples could include He/Him, She/Her, They/Them) in your nickname after your character’s name.","created_at":"2021-07-05T23:41:45.229000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"861753752595595305","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"Hateful language will not be tolerated. We want to be inclusive to all our players and make them feel welcome. Any language that is disrespectful towards anyone based on their religion, politics, skin color, sexuality, etc etc will not be tolerated.\nIn conflicts between players (not to be confused with the conflict between player characters which can be a part of story arc, and shouldn’t be taken personally) do your best to be kind, courteous and helpful. This style of gaming is very dependent on interpersonal relations, and a sour note will resonate throughout the server. We recognize that many are going through tough times here. It is better to see our game as a haven from the real world, to be a place where you can deal with your anxieties and frustrations in a healthy, mutually consensual way. Hate language will not be tolerated.","created_at":"2021-07-05T23:42:12.415000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"861753866622337054","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
